# Record: vhs docs/demo/demo.tape  (from the repo root)
Output docs/demo/demo.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 480
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "clear && uv run --quiet python docs/demo/demo.py 2>/dev/null" Enter
Show
Sleep 24s
